CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
DESCRIPTION:The Watson Fellowship is a one-year $40\,000 grant for purpose
 ful\, independent exploration outside the United States\, awarded to grad
 uating seniors nominated by one of 41 partner colleges. \nProgram Informa
 tion: https://fellowships.davidson.edu/Watson\nApplication Deadline: Sept
 ember 30\, 2026 at 3 p.m. EDT\nGeneral Eligibility:\n- Graduating seniors
  (Class of 2027)\n- No citizenship requirements\n- Must be nominated by D
 avidson College.\nFor more information and to access the nomination appli
 cation materials\, visit https://fellowships.davidson.edu/Watson and foll
 ow the link to Davidson's Watson Fellowship application toolkit.\n\nHoste
 d by: Catalyst\, Office of Fellowships\n\nOnline Location: http://fellows
 hips.davidson.edu/Watson \n\nAdditional Information can be found at: http
 s://wildcatsync.davidson.edu/event/12460064
DTEND:20260930T190100Z
DTSTAMP:20260930T143828Z
DTSTART:20260930T190000Z
LOCATION:Online
