BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:Spirituality
DESCRIPTION:Interested in Meditation? In Zen or Buddhism? Or just a place 
 to look a little more creatively and deeply into this process called life
  or what being human is all about? Wednesday Night Zen is the place to be
 ! Hosted by Buddhism at Davidson and led by Associate Chaplain for Buddhi
 st Programs Iván Mayerhofer as well as student leaders\, the evening cons
 ists of a period of meditation (with instructions)\, a brief reflection o
 n practice\, and then a topic of discussion. Informed by Buddhist teachin
 gs\, the evening doesn't require anyone to be Buddhist or have any experi
 ence with meditation. Come and see what this is all about! \nRegular week
 ly service is from 7pm - 8pm in the Oasis\, Chaplains' Office\, 4th Floor
  of the Union.\nNew For this Year - Come Early at 6:30pm for an additiona
 l period of non-guided silent meditation. Starts at 6:30pm and ends at 6:
 55pm with a brief chant of the refuges or Heart Sutra. Join at any time d
 uring this additional period!\nAlso - stay after the 7pm-8pm service from
  8pm - 8:30pm for tea and conversation! Many ways to engage that fit your
  life. See you at Wednesday Night Zen!  \n\nHosted by: Buddhism at Davids
 on\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://wildcatsync.davidso
 n.edu/event/12565464
DTEND:20261001T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260930T143828Z
DTSTART:20260930T230000Z
LOCATION:Oasis
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Wednesday Night Zen
UID:https://wildcatsync.davidson.edu/event/12565464
URL:https://wildcatsync.davidson.edu/event/12565464
X-HOSTS:Buddhism at Davidson
END:VEVENT
