DESCRIPTION:Interested in learning a little more about our organizations a
 t Davidson College? Ever wanted to give an “Oh So Fly” Pi Chi a little sp
 lash? 💦 Or maybe you want to see just how chivalrous a Lambda can be?\nT
 he Pi Chis & Lambdas invite you to Splash the MGC! 🎈💦 Come out to learn
  more about our organizations\, launch some water balloons at our members
 \, put the Pi Chis to the test\, and see if our chivalrous Lambdas can st
 ay dry! Plus\, enjoy a FREE FROZEN TREAT as a thank-you for stopping by a
 nd supporting our organizations!\nCome make a splash\, meet some new peop
 le\, and have some fun with the Pi Chis & Lambdas!\n \n(Check out our acc
 ount\, @/mgcdavidson\, on IG for more information 🤫)\n\nHosted by: The A
 lpha Gamma Chapter of Latinas Promoviendo Comunidad/Lambda Pi Chi Sororit
 y\, Inc.\, The Delta Omega Chapter of Lambda Theta Phi Latin Fraternity\,
  Inc.\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://wildcatsync.davi
 dson.edu/event/12785396
